{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1689388990_5826494_5a61cbd545143d88c3d20e5cce907c9btm-logo.png",
  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">&bull; Brand Introduction:</span></span></span></span></strong> </span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> Welcome to Wisleey, your go-to destination for smart watches that combine style and function. </span></span></span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">As a cross-border e-commerce pioneer brand, we focus on providing fashion-forward and feature-rich smart watches to make your life easier. </span></span></span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Our range of smartwatches are designed to monitor important health parameters like heart rate, blood pressure and sleep, while keeping you connected. </span></span></span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span class=\"\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">From fitness enthusiasts to busy professionals, our smartwatches meet different customer needs and help them lead a healthier and more convenient lifestyle. </span></span></span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Explore our collections and experience the perfect fusion of technology and style.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span class=\"\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">&bull; Product Description:</span></span></span></span></strong></span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span class=\"\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> Discover the perfect blend of fashion, function and wellness with Wisleey's collection of smart watches. </span></span></span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span class=\"\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Designed for both men and women, our smartwatches offer a variety of features to suit your lifestyle needs. </span></span></span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">From heart rate, blood pressure, sleep monitoring to fitness tracking with multiple sports modes, our smartwatch is your personal health assistant. </span></span></span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">They are waterproof and perfect for an active lifestyle. </span></span></span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">With sleek designs and a wide range of styles to choose from, our smartwatches are more than just a tech accessory, they're a fashion statement. </span></span></span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Experience the perfect blend of technology and style with Wisleey's smartwatch.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</span></span></span></span></strong></span></p>\r\n<ol style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Health Monitoring</span></span></span></span></strong><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> : Your smartwatch provides comprehensive health monitoring features, including heart rate, blood pressure, body temperature and sleep tracking. </span></span></span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">This makes them the perfect companion for the health-conscious person.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">STYLISH DESIGN</span></span></span></span></strong><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> : Unlike many smartwatches on the market, your product design puts a lot of emphasis on aesthetics. </span></span></span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">They come in a variety of styles and colors, making them a stylish accessory to complement any outfit.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Affordable price</span></span></span></span></strong><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> : Despite its advanced features and stylish design, your smart watch is affordable and suitable for a wide range of customers.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Durability</span></span></span></span></strong><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> : Your smartwatch is waterproof and durable for an active lifestyle.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Women-specific features</span></span></span></span></strong><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> : Some of your smartwatches offer unique features, such as menstrual cycle tracking, specifically tailored to the needs of women.</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">&bull; payment terms:</span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n<ol style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Pay Now</span></span></span></span></strong><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> : At Wisleey, we value your time and strive to make your shopping experience as seamless as possible. </span></span></span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Therefore, we require payment at the time of purchase. </span></span></span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">This ensures that we can process your order quickly and ship your smartwatch to you immediately.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Multiple Payment Methods</span></span></span></span></strong><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> : We understand that everyone has their favorite payment method. </span></span></span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">That's why we offer a variety of payment methods for your convenience. </span></span></span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">You can choose to pay by credit card or PayPal, two of the most trusted and secure payment platforms in the world. </span></span></span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span class=\"\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Simply select your preferred payment method at checkout and you'll be guided through the payment process. </span></span></span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">It's that simple!</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">&bull; other information:</span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Support and Resources</span></span></span></span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> :</span></span></span></span></span><strong> </strong></span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> At Wisleey, we believe in providing our partners with the right tools to succeed. </span></span></span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">As part of our partnership, we provide a comprehensive set of resources to help you promote our products. </span></span></span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">This includes high-quality product images and videos showcasing the unique features and style of our smartwatches. </span></span></span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">We also provide detailed operation manuals and product specification sheets to help you better understand our products. </span></span></span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">These resources are designed to provide you with the knowledge and materials necessary to create engaging content and effectively market our products. </span></span></span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">We are here to support you every step of the way. </span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">(Also, if you have any other requests or need further assistance, please feel free to contact us.)</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>",
